PackageIdentifier: KingJayan.DesmosIDE
PackageVersion: {{VERSION}}
PackageLocale: en-US
Publisher: KingJayan
PublisherUrl: https://github.com/KingJayan
PackageName: Desmos IDE
PackageUrl: https://github.com/{{REPO}}
License: Apache-2.0
LicenseUrl: https://github.com/{{REPO}}/blob/main/LICENSE
ShortDescription: An IDE for Desmos with a custom DSL
Description: |-
  Desmos IDE writes Desmos graphs from a small typed language. The editor, the graph and
  the compiler sit in one window: an edit on either side reaches the other.

  The installer is not signed with an Authenticode certificate, so SmartScreen reports an
  unknown publisher.
